<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">CAMPUS INTELLIGENCE</text><view class="heading">你好，我是智办助手。</view><view class="muted">描述想办的事，我来整理流程、材料与表单。</view><view class="card"><textarea value="{{message}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="2000" placeholder="例如：我想申请奖学金…" disabled="{{loading}}"/><button class="gap" bindtap="send" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading || !message}}">{{loading?'正在分析与规划':'生成办理计划 ↗'}}</button><text wx:for="{{hints}}" wx:key="*this" class="pill" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="hint">{{item}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card pulse"><text class="badge">正在识别事项、检索指南与规划步骤…</text><view class="muted gap">结果返回后展示工具执行记录；复杂请求可能需要一分钟。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{run}}"><view class="card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">你的办理计划</text><text class="badge">{{run.mode==='live'?'实时 AI':run.mode==='fallback'?'降级参考':'离线演示'}}</text></view><text selectable class="muted">{{run.answer}}</text><view wx:if="{{run.warning}}" class="error">模型暂时不可用，当前显示知识库参考清单。</view><view wx:for="{{run.steps}}" wx:key="title" class="step"><text class="step-no {{item.status==='done'?'done':''}}">{{index+1}}</text><view class="step-body"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.description}}</view></view></view><view class="gap"><text class="badge">执行记录</text><view wx:for="{{run.trace}}" wx:key="index" class="muted small">✓ {{item.tool}}</view></view><view class="divider"/><view wx:for="{{run.citations}}" wx:key="sourceId" class="muted small">来源：{{item.title}}</view></view><view class="stack" wx:if="{{run.steps.length}}"><button bindtap="ocr">上传材料并识别</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="form">生成表单草稿</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="save">保存为办理任务</button></view></view><view class="notice">请勿提供与办理无关的敏感信息。AI 草稿由你核对，校方审批仍需通过正式渠道。</view></view>